#: src/application.vala:32
msgid "Manage and create Docker Compose projects"
msgstr "Gestionar y crear proyectos de Docker Compose"

#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons.
#: data/dockstation.desktop.in:10
msgid "docker;compose;container;devops;"
msgstr "docker;compose;container;contenedor;devops;"

#: data/dockstation.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid "DockStation keeps all your Docker Compose projects in one place. Start, stop and restart services, follow their logs, edit the configuration and create new projects from ready-made templates."
msgstr "DockStation reúne todos sus proyectos de Docker Compose en un solo lugar. Inicie, detenga y reinicie servicios, siga sus registros, edite la configuración y cree proyectos nuevos a partir de plantillas listas para usar."

